Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:52.24,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:57.24,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:03:02.24,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, Mina_Mi, Zero Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:56.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young, where did you feel the power of the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:57.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Father
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:58.94,general text,,0,0,0,,We are close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Rock somewhere nearby under water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:13.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you really think she found the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:14.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, it should be him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.91,0:01:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,10 years ago my teacher Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:20.29,general text,,0,0,0,,hid the stone here in Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.30,general text,,0,0,0,,And now the stone was found by a girl born
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.67,general text,,0,0,0,,using the power of the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:30.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Boo Young is Chang Gun's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:34.10,general text,,0,0,0,,This explains why he saved her with magic
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:37.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t you like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:48.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this girl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:51.78,general text,,0,0,0,,worthless, I was able to marry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:55.24,general text,,0,0,0,,daughters of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:59.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess I should be grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:05.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Here. The rock is right below us
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:20.60,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Father’s complexes and jealousy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.69,0:02:23.44,offscreen,,0,0,0,,led Jin Bu Young to death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Suits you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.41,general text,,0,0,0,,If you like it, then I like it, mom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:35.16,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's try something else
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:40.37,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The incredible strength of Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.50,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,she got it not only from her mother, a member of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:48.88,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,She is also strong thanks to the blood of her father, a descendant of the fallen Choi family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:55.26,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Brother and sister Choi, who made a living from fortune telling,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:58.72,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,were the descendants of the magician Choi, the first who committed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:00.56,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.27,0:03:05.56,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young was a descendant of both families,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:09.32,voiceover,,0,0,0,,which made her the strongest priestess the world has seen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:12.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You finally found him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.74,0:03:16.12,general text,,0,0,0,,give me the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:29.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Bu Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Eat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:11.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Here, hold the spoon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.63,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity that you’re blind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:17.43,general text,,0,0,0,,The worst thing is that you don’t even remember your name
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.89,0:04:22.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to live with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:26.65,general text,,0,0,0,,My deceased granddaughter's name was Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:27.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:33.61,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on you are Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.53,0:04:36.15,general text,,0,0,0,,How sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:38.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's eat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:29.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:38.30,memories,,0,0,0,,Bu Young...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:54.98,general text,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:59.74,general text,,0,0,0,,This happened on the day Bu Young disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok has not returned
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:17.71,general text,,0,0,0,,The nomad probably killed him and Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:20.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we will all die
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:27.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Bu Young
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.77,0:06:30.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You yourself brought the stone from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.23,0:06:33.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a priestess, but you can’t control him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:37.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I followed my mother's instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:39.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.20,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul lost too much blood
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Without a transfusion he may die
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:50.71,general text,,0,0,0,,If you need blood, you can take mine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You cannot cast spells here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:55.00,general text,,0,0,0,,so your blood cannot be used
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:03.93,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Reach out your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:16.69,memories,,0,0,0,,A worm from the blood of my daughter Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.57,memories italics,,0,0,0,,will give you the powers of the Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:26.41,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook fooled us all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:32.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Mages of the Unified Council took turns reading “Words of the Heart”,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.12,general text,,0,0,0,,but there is not a word about the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:36.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing more than a poem
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,What will Sosnovy Bor say to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,All magicians read it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:49.81,general text,,0,0,0,,but no one knew something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:59.98,memories,,0,0,0,,"Words of the heart" - a love letter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:01.40,memories,,0,0,0,,Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:04.20,memories,,0,0,0,,Message?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:08.33,memories,,0,0,0,,Love Letter to Jin Seol Ran,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:09.87,memories,,0,0,0,,the first chapter of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.29,0:08:15.37,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an admission that he did not destroy the stone because
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:19.50,general text,,0,0,0,,that I couldn’t let go of my beloved who was dying
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:23.51,general text,,0,0,0,,So, Master So Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:26.93,general text,,0,0,0,,didn’t destroy the stone because of love?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:29.55,general text,,0,0,0,,He's trying to fool you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:33.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I can prove that this is a love letter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:38.11,general text,,0,0,0,,It is enough to name the recipient’s name in your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:42.07,general text,,0,0,0,,and you can read this letter yourself, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I can read the poem
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:46.66,general text,,0,0,0,,even without being a magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.70,italics,,0,0,0,,Recipient's name
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.78,0:08:53.08,general text,,0,0,0,,will remind you of “an orchid flower that is covered in snow”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:56.50,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Sol Ran
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.21,general text,,0,0,0,,"Salt Ran"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:34.95,general text,,0,0,0,,"I see the blue firmament. A quiet sigh is heard"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:46.88,general text,,0,0,0,,"I know my eyes will fill with tears again"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.13,general text,,0,0,0,,"But I'm a fool,"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.01,general text,,0,0,0,,"didn't roll down my cheek"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:56.39,italics,,0,0,0,,"not a single tear"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.40,general text,,0,0,0,,This is his confession
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:03.90,general text,,0,0,0,,that he did not destroy the stone for the sake of his beloved
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:09.53,general text,,0,0,0,,But head Jin Seol Ran died
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.61,0:10:11.62,general text,,0,0,0,,about six months later
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:16.08,general text,,0,0,0,,after the founding of Jinyaewon due to injuries received during the Great Chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,If the stone was for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:19.83,general text,,0,0,0,,why didn’t she use it and save herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:24.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m sure this is so that the world doesn’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:26.67,general text,,0,0,0,,such dangerous power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:31.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Who would refuse such power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.80,general text,,0,0,0,,A person like you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:36.31,general text,,0,0,0,,would never act like her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.39,0:10:39.10,general text,,0,0,0,,And she did it for the sake of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:41.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Did the right thing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.90,general text,,0,0,0,,To protect what is due
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:53.62,general text,,0,0,0,,sometimes someone has to give up everything
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Since you picked up the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.39,general text,,0,0,0,,make your choice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:21.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that you were avoiding me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:24.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that our lives are in your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.07,0:11:30.74,general text,,0,0,0,,As promised, point your sword at me first
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.08,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Excessive energy will lead to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:47.84,memories italics,,0,0,0,,that you cannot control the power you use
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.80,0:11:51.42,memories,,0,0,0,,If you want rain, you will get a flood
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:54.76,memories,,0,0,0,,If you want wind, you will get a typhoon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.51,memories,,0,0,0,,Try to cope
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:59.47,memories,,0,0,0,,So, I won’t be able to control this power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:03.60,memories,,0,0,0,,Something you can do of your own free will
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:07.02,memories,,0,0,0,,Do not use it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:11.65,memories,,0,0,0,,The choice is yours: to use force or not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Now, as you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:31.05,general text,,0,0,0,,give me another promise
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:49.11,italics,,0,0,0,,Among the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.19,0:12:52.48,italics,,0,0,0,,there is the saddest one - the King’s star
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.61,0:12:56.78,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of star is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:58.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Born under her sign
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.91,0:13:01.20,general text,,0,0,0,,can control the energy of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.87,general text,,0,0,0,,So the person will be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:05.62,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:09.96,general text,,0,0,0,,How to say... It's not always something good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:12.00,general text,,0,0,0,,The greater the power -
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.09,0:13:14.05,general text,,0,0,0,,the greater the responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:16.09,general text,,0,0,0,,What is “responsibility”?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.64,general text,,0,0,0,,This is when you have to do something you don’t want to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.97,general text,,0,0,0,,even if you feel sad and lonely later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:24.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Ajusshi, can I eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:26.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:30.73,general text,,0,0,0,,- I should have given it earlier\N- Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:34.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Just don’t fight over them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:36.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. We went
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.25,general text,,0,0,0,,The star will appear soon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Then those who should disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:54.92,general text,,0,0,0,,and those who need it will return
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince was looking for this place
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:08.48,general text,,0,0,0,,The shop where every month
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.94,general text,,0,0,0,,eunuch Kim, the queen's servant, walked
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:13.27,general text,,0,0,0,,You know your way around well
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:16.44,general text,,0,0,0,,And that talisman, so that the beloved falls in love...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:17.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you get it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:22.16,general text,,0,0,0,,It didn’t even work, stop making fun of me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:26.20,general text,,0,0,0,,How did it “not work”? We're together now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:28.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.33,general text,,0,0,0,,We’re not on a date
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:43.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.27,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Herbalist’s shop
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:49.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Come to your senses
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:32.44,general text,,0,0,0,,They tried to harm themselves again, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:34.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you keeping me alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:37.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Just kill already
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:40.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Not yet. Queen's Lantern of Life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:44.49,general text,,0,0,0,,must burn while the queen's body is still alive
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.45,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s scary that you look at me like that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,with my sister’s face
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:56.29,general text,,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t be angry with me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:15:58.17,general text,,0,0,0,,The one who put it is to blame
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:01.38,general text,,0,0,0,,my sister and I are in this situation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:15.81,memories,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi, you cursed and harmed people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:17.94,memories,,0,0,0,,using forbidden spells
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.40,memories,,0,0,0,,Do you admit your sins?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:29.78,memories,,0,0,0,,I did for money what people asked
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.87,0:16:33.50,memories,,0,0,0,,It’s the fault of those who asked me to curse someone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.42,memories,,0,0,0,,Your curse led to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:38.33,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you pretending to be innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:44.72,memories,,0,0,0,,Spells that can kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:46.34,memories,,0,0,0,,Amazed by your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.97,0:16:48.09,memories,,0,0,0,,This power
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:53.47,memories,,0,0,0,,may even be enough to kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:02.78,memories,,0,0,0,,Find all the spell books, everything she used!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:03.78,memories,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:22.92,memories,,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.05,memories,,0,0,0,,We are a poor family,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:27.13,memories,,0,0,0,,but this is our family heirloom
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:29.51,memories,,0,0,0,,I didn’t guess with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:30.76,memories,,0,0,0,,Don’t burn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:32.51,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Chongan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:33.77,memories,,0,0,0,,This is a book of spells
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.85,0:17:34.89,memories,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:36.60,memories,,0,0,0,,Burn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:43.27,memories,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:45.19,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Chongan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:03.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:04.25,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:15.10,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Chongan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.11,0:18:25.40,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:27.53,memories,,0,0,0,,"Alchemy of Souls"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:43.04,memories,,0,0,0,,Be patient, sister
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:03.27,italics,,0,0,0,,It all started with him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:04.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He left these scars
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:08.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Because of him, my sister transferred her soul to your body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,It's his fault
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:12.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:15.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Gan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.16,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t die yet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Live in my sister's body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.34,general text,,0,0,0,,just a little more,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:28.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:36.26,general text,,0,0,0,,More than ten years have passed since I got this body
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:40.77,general text,,0,0,0,,But every time she regains consciousness, it affects me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:44.73,general text,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for the lantern of Life, I would have killed her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:47.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Your brother brought her medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.44,0:19:50.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You will feel better soon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.78,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:56.82,general text,,0,0,0,,How did the stone end up in Chongjingak?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:58.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Ho Kyung was probably mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:00.75,general text,,0,0,0,,because I used the stone for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,When the time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:07.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I use the power of the stone for the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:12.63,general text,,0,0,0,,If you do this now, everyone in Jeongjingak will die
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:15.97,general text,,0,0,0,,The Crown Prince is there too
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:18.97,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:23.06,general text,,0,0,0,,We must wait for him to be rescued from there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:24.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you can collect the power of the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.02,general text,,0,0,0,,What if they don’t rescue him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I just sit and wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.23,0:20:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,What if something takes the stone before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:36.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, no one is doing anything, everyone is just on alert
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:41.58,general text,,0,0,0,,We must find a way to save the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:56.88,memories,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:04.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:07.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Why would she call me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:09.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Laughter and nothing more
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,All
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:21.03,general text,,0,0,0,,more worried about the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:25.54,general text,,0,0,0,,than the children locked there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:30.04,general text,,0,0,0,,You and I must try to destroy the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's do something without the consent of the council,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,there will be a scandal again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.01,0:21:41.35,general text,,0,0,0,,The stone belongs to Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:44.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor has no right to make decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:45.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,the stone never really left the walls of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.94,general text,,0,0,0,,over the last 200 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.57,0:21:57.28,italics,,0,0,0,,You once said that the magician of Sosnovy Bor had already entered Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:59.07,general text,,0,0,0,,This is random
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.07,0:22:02.33,general text,,0,0,0,,wasn’t Chang Gan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:08.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked a question
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:12.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Has Chang Gang ever used a stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:26.22,memories,,0,0,0,,The baby inside does not move
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.31,0:22:28.02,memories,,0,0,0,,I carried her for 13 months
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.89,0:22:30.02,memories,,0,0,0,,I can’t let her go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.36,0:22:33.61,memories,,0,0,0,,I have to save her
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.23,0:22:35.94,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.69,memories,,0,0,0,,She's already dead
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:45.20,memories,,0,0,0,,In Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:47.87,memories,,0,0,0,,there is an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.83,0:22:51.17,memories,,0,0,0,,Ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.67,memories,,0,0,0,,Why surprise? You already suspected
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.75,0:22:57.09,memories,,0,0,0,,You asked to go to Jinyeowon so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:23:00.55,memories,,0,0,0,,I know you wanted to find a stone there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.76,memories,,0,0,0,,They say the stone can
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:09.89,memories,,0,0,0,,bring the dead back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:12.48,memories,,0,0,0,,I don’t have enough strength
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:15.90,memories,,0,0,0,,control the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:17.82,memories,,0,0,0,,But to you, Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.69,0:23:20.78,memories,,0,0,0,,strength may be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.95,0:23:25.03,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you asking to use dark magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.12,0:23:27.79,memories,,0,0,0,,I will do everything to save my child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:31.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:34.92,memories,,0,0,0,,Help me save him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.68,0:23:49.39,voiceover,,0,0,0,,That night I opened Jinyoewon’s door and let him in
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:52.31,voiceover,,0,0,0,,hoping that he will save my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:56.98,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,And as a result, Jinyeowon lost the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:06.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if so,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.66,0:24:09.91,general text,,0,0,0,,there is more guilt behind Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:13.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Your magician always portrayed the righteous, but still
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.62,0:24:15.46,general text,,0,0,0,,took the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:18.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Created the alchemy of souls and cast chaos on the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.59,0:24:23.76,general text,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to hide it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.18,0:24:26.22,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.43,0:24:30.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do everything to reveal the truth and correct everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.77,0:24:34.23,general text,,0,0,0,,even if you have to reveal the sins of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.98,0:24:37.40,general text,,0,0,0,,and punish the guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:44.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Then you will have to pass judgment on the person dear to you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:48.53,general text,,0,0,0,,It won’t be easy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.58,0:24:51.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.16,0:24:55.12,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.87,0:25:00.09,general text,,0,0,0,,if this is the only way to fix the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.30,0:25:05.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll do it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.52,0:25:17.69,general text,,0,0,0,,My sister's soul will replace your body
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:21.69,general text,,0,0,0,,on the body of a girl who pretends to be my eldest daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:24.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.15,0:25:27.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I will kill you, as you ask
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:44.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.09,0:25:47.30,italics,,0,0,0,,what...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.38,0:25:48.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.51,0:25:52.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.81,0:25:54.93,general text,,0,0,0,,what the..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.23,0:25:58.06,general text,,0,0,0,,nonsense... I just
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.23,0:26:00.48,general text,,0,0,0,,heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.86,0:26:07.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.03,0:26:11.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Is imprisoned in this body
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.58,0:26:15.54,general text,,0,0,0,,soul of a real queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.11,0:26:47.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Father, stop
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.25,0:27:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.30,0:27:52.55,general text,,0,0,0,,is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.27,0:28:03.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.35,0:28:05.77,general text,,0,0,0,,long time no see
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.07,0:28:11.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.32,0:28:52.69,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.65,0:28:57.87,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook must have killed him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.45,0:28:59.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Defeated with one blow
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:03.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Spells cannot be cast here. How did he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.33,0:29:08.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Where are Chan Wook and Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.08,0:29:09.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Find them
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.88,0:29:11.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.89,0:29:25.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I had a vision when I felt the energy of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.06,0:29:28.56,general text,,0,0,0,,The girl said that no one can own the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.65,0:29:30.31,general text,,0,0,0,,You can only use force
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.44,0:29:33.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Because this is the energy of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.82,0:29:35.49,general text,,0,0,0,,We must train,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.07,0:29:39.24,general text,,0,0,0,,to control even the energy within us
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:42.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The energy of the sky, of course, is beyond our capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.28,0:29:46.62,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot use it freely because it does not belong to us
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.42,0:29:50.83,general text,,0,0,0,,If you can’t master it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.92,0:29:53.50,general text,,0,0,0,,What if I give away all of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.21,0:29:55.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.67,0:29:59.30,general text,,0,0,0,,What if I put all my energy into the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.01,0:30:02.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Then my energy will become the energy of the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.93,0:30:08.06,general text,,0,0,0,,I read the notes about the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:10.02,general text,,0,0,0,,in the secret library of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.81,0:30:14.73,italics,,0,0,0,,They say ice stone has no shape
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.82,0:30:17.65,italics,,0,0,0,,It could be water, fire or wind
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.74,0:30:19.95,italics,,0,0,0,,Unable to know its size
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.03,0:30:23.37,italics,,0,0,0,,It can be either tiny or huge
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.41,0:30:28.37,general text,,0,0,0,,This means that the barrier surrounding Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.46,0:30:30.29,general text,,0,0,0,,not the real form of the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.83,0:30:32.88,general text,,0,0,0,,He can turn into water or fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.96,0:30:35.67,general text,,0,0,0,,become larger or smaller than now
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.42,0:30:37.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.55,0:30:41.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can turn the fog into rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:42.72,general text,,0,0,0,,In the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:45.64,general text,,0,0,0,,You said my strength is nothing compared to the power of the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.27,0:30:48.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Only a drop of water is within my power
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.23,0:30:52.73,general text,,0,0,0,,And if this drop is turned into thousands of raindrops?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.69,0:30:56.82,general text,,0,0,0,,It will rain
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.90,0:30:58.44,general text,,0,0,0,,This might work
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.32,0:31:01.24,general text,,0,0,0,,But for this you need to use Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.32,0:31:03.66,general text,,0,0,0,,- Then...\N- Then I will lose all my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.70,0:31:07.83,general text,,0,0,0,,So I said I have to give it all away
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:13.00,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:14.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Come up with another way
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.88,0:31:17.75,general text,,0,0,0,,We must hurry, otherwise the queen will gather all the power of the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.76,0:31:19.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we will all die
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.01,0:31:23.76,general text,,0,0,0,,The council is watching her, she won’t do anything rash
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.39,0:31:26.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, no need
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.51,0:31:29.14,general text,,0,0,0,,As your teacher, I command
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.90,0:31:40.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave up trying to regain my power,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.61,0:31:42.32,general text,,0,0,0,,but I won’t let you waste mine
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.74,0:31:45.82,general text,,0,0,0,,You and I have come so far
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.66,0:31:48.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I spurred you on so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.33,0:31:50.91,general text,,0,0,0,,and you risked your life so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.50,0:31:59.96,general text,,0,0,0,,And are you ready to give up everything for one drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.51,0:32:05.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul is seriously wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.26,0:32:07.89,general text,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, he will die
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.60,0:32:14.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:18.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You gave up everything to protect me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.19,0:32:23.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to protect you too
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.49,0:32:28.53,general text,,0,0,0,,And Yul also protected you all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.13,0:32:42.13,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Without a transfusion he could die
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.51,0:32:48.05,italics,,0,0,0,,This worm is from the blood of the Jin family...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.14,0:32:49.76,general text,,0,0,0,,If you give it to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.38,0:33:28.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t die, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.60,0:33:31.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Stay alive
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.63,0:34:04.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Remove the reflector. What if someone sees?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:06.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.22,0:34:09.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I must return the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.18,0:34:11.35,general text,,0,0,0,,using a reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.76,0:34:15.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:16.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You cannot cast magic with a reflector,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.93,0:34:18.60,general text,,0,0,0,,while the Unified Council is here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.15,0:34:21.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Conjure?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.73,0:34:27.19,general text,,0,0,0,,This reflector was made of ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:30.11,general text,,0,0,0,,But the stone is considered good, and the reflector is evil
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.20,0:34:32.32,general text,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.41,0:34:36.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Consider it ridiculous, but this is the order of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.50,0:34:39.25,general text,,0,0,0,,We do this so that you can come out of the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.33,0:34:41.79,general text,,0,0,0,,without the stigma of a witch
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.54,0:34:43.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Shameful stigma?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.13,0:34:48.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You've come this far using my family's alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.09,0:34:50.63,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you treat this with contempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.55,0:34:58.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying that the alchemy of souls is an unrecognized witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.81,0:35:02.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should the world admit this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:06.07,general text,,0,0,0,,When we found the ice stone at Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.15,0:35:09.78,general text,,0,0,0,,we could use his power to elevate the Choi family
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.86,0:35:10.86,general text,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.95,0:35:14.03,general text,,0,0,0,,you insisted that I enter the queen’s body,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.12,0:35:16.41,general text,,0,0,0,,created a secret organization in Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.49,0:35:17.66,general text,,0,0,0,,and now
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.54,0:35:22.46,general text,,0,0,0,,you demand to reveal the ice stone to the world through Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.79,0:35:27.84,general text,,0,0,0,,It was too dangerous to go against the world with the help of witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.92,0:35:31.76,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s not about the danger, but about your contempt
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.26,0:35:34.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to be branded for witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.80,0:35:38.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to use power so that everyone would worship you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.27,0:35:44.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you so desperately seeking recognition?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.77,0:35:50.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Because you can’t come to terms with the fact that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:53.99,general text,,0,0,0,,born due to his father’s affair and was never recognized
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:59.45,general text,,0,0,0,,member of the Jin family, why did you have to wag your tail like a little dog in front of everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.05,0:36:18.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the position of the queen has become a burden for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.18,0:36:22.39,general text,,0,0,0,,that she previously received pennies for her fortune telling
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.73,0:36:31.53,general text,,0,0,0,,If it’s so difficult, I’ll get you a couple of human victims
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.61,0:36:36.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Have enough of their souls and pull yourself together
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.39,0:37:06.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Have you found the real queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.73,0:37:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you bring her to Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.36,0:37:12.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.40,0:37:14.24,general text,,0,0,0,,She is with Jin Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.07,0:37:18.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Take her to the scientific hall
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.91,0:37:20.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I will reveal the truth to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.16,0:37:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,No, chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.95,0:37:26.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell this only to the royal family and the people of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.50,0:37:31.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the future head of Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.80,0:37:35.59,general text,,0,0,0,,but you stand here and worry about Jinyoewon’s reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.30,0:37:38.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t deny it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.68,0:37:43.89,general text,,0,0,0,,But Sosnovy Bor is also responsible for this
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.60,0:37:49.27,general text,,0,0,0,,The Mage of Sosnovy Bor was the beginning of everything
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:52.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Mage from Sosnovy Bor? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.15,0:37:56.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Jang Wook's father, Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.63,0:38:18.38,italics,,0,0,0,,At the request of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.47,0:38:21.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I sent everyone away except the magicians Jeonbugwan and Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.05,0:38:24.68,general text,,0,0,0,,What do you want to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.18,0:38:30.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that the Crown Prince was looking for someone recently
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.48,0:38:33.52,italics,,0,0,0,,Pak Dan Gu, the magician of Jeonjingak,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.61,0:38:36.78,general text,,0,0,0,,and Jin Cho Young, the priestess of Jinyoung found this man
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.24,0:38:40.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Was the Crown Prince looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.28,0:38:42.57,general text,,0,0,0,,And who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.20,0:38:46.75,general text,,0,0,0,,This person is here now
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.71,0:38:53.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard someone threw a stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.08,0:38:55.80,general text,,0,0,0,,where it is written that the ice stone takes away strength when casting spells
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.88,0:38:58.84,general text,,0,0,0,,They can’t cast spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.92,0:39:01.30,general text,,0,0,0,,The same power is used in the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.38,0:39:04.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess the stone takes away strength the same way it sucks out souls
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.85,0:39:08.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Then what will happen to our children?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:10.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You all wanted to kill someone so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.81,0:39:13.40,general text,,0,0,0,,to see the power of the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.48,0:39:15.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you scared now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.94,0:39:19.86,general text,,0,0,0,,The power of the ice stone is beyond the control of humans
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.95,0:39:22.78,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why Sosnovy Bor insisted on its destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.86,0:39:24.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Then Sosnovy Bor must take action
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.45,0:39:27.41,general text,,0,0,0,,My son is there
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.49,0:39:28.95,general text,,0,0,0,,My granddaughter too
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:32.33,general text,,0,0,0,,If only I knew what to do, I wouldn’t just stand here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.67,0:39:35.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone here was thirsty
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.29,0:39:37.63,general text,,0,0,0,,the power of heaven, and look where it led
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.42,0:39:40.84,general text,,0,0,0,,What if this leads to Chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:43.68,general text,,0,0,0,,like 200 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.26,0:39:45.35,general text,,0,0,0,,So Kyung...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.35,0:39:48.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So Kyung destroyed the ice stones
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.47,0:39:52.31,general text,,0,0,0,,He left nothing but “Words of the Heart”?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.39,0:39:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,This poem is the only thing we have
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.32,0:39:59.57,general text,,0,0,0,,We have called upon the power of the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.65,0:40:02.28,general text,,0,0,0,,one of us needs to fix this,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.24,0:40:05.78,general text,,0,0,0,,like Master So Kyung many years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.21,0:40:15.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Call down rain to dispel the power of the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.13,0:40:17.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Not sure if it will rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:21.17,general text,,0,0,0,,and will this rain be able to rid us of the barrier
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.01,0:40:23.55,general text,,0,0,0,,One thing is for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.47,0:40:26.05,general text,,0,0,0,,If you use Tansu here...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.01,0:40:28.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Uk...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.01,0:40:31.02,general text,,0,0,0,,you will lose all your energy
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.14,0:40:33.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:35.10,general text,,0,0,0,,And still want to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.02,0:40:40.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you are not a top-level magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.86,0:40:43.82,general text,,0,0,0,,but you still went through a lot to get this far
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.49,0:40:46.03,general text,,0,0,0,,And you agree to lose everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.12,0:40:50.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.37,0:40:53.46,general text,,0,0,0,,But I want you to help me with something
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:57.79,general text,,0,0,0,,If the ice stone disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.46,0:41:01.30,general text,,0,0,0,,take care of the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.97,0:41:06.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Those who craved his power will be indignant
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.63,0:41:10.31,general text,,0,0,0,,They may suspect something is wrong and think that it is hidden somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.39,0:41:14.60,general text,,0,0,0,,That is, act as if I destroyed the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:16.81,general text,,0,0,0,,and deal with the consequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.90,0:41:20.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Take responsibility for what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.23,0:41:22.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I ask you to put everything in order
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.36,0:41:25.07,general text,,0,0,0,,after the mess I make
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.16,0:41:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.95,0:41:34.20,general text,,0,0,0,,in addition to energy, you can lose your life
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.29,0:41:36.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be stupid, just forget about it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.08,0:41:41.00,general text,,0,0,0,,My amazing teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.54,0:41:44.76,general text,,0,0,0,,always pushed me to the edge of a cliff and said the following:
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.30,0:41:48.76,italics,,0,0,0,,"Better to die than to do nothing"
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.10,0:41:54.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I will try not out of stupidity, but out of obstinacy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.73,0:41:57.64,general text,,0,0,0,,This is what my teacher taught me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.90,0:42:03.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you had a teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.90,0:42:07.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is this? Master Lee Chul?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.78,0:42:10.78,italics,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.58,0:42:15.75,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.54,0:42:23.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.96,0:42:27.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you going to talk him out of this recklessness?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.01,0:42:32.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Better to die than to do nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.60,0:42:37.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Host,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.06,0:42:40.60,general text,,0,0,0,,do what you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.19,0:42:42.23,general text,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.15,0:42:44.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I believe in you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.21,0:43:08.21,general text,,0,0,0,,The person who will enter here is in a terrible state
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.80,0:43:10.13,general text,,0,0,0,,20 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.22,0:43:13.60,general text,,0,0,0,,she threw herself into the fire to hide from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.43,0:43:21.64,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a shaman, she was telling fortunes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:24.15,general text,,0,0,0,,and cursed people
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.28,0:43:28.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.28,0:43:33.07,general text,,0,0,0,,She was locked like an animal for a very long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.16,0:43:36.74,general text,,0,0,0,,in a tiny dungeon in the herbalist’s shop in the village of Gema
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.20,0:43:42.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Why was she locked?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.12,0:43:44.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I asked you to convene this meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.00,0:43:47.42,general text,,0,0,0,,hoping to find out, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.17,0:43:50.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Everyone who is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.80,0:43:56.26,general text,,0,0,0,,connected with Shaman Choi, a woman who will soon enter this room
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.06,0:44:00.31,general text,,0,0,0,,- That's it?\N- {\i1}Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.39,0:44:02.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time for this
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.31,0:44:04.85,italics,,0,0,0,,Ice stone is more important
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.94,0:44:06.90,general text,,0,0,0,,It is more important to save the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.40,0:44:18.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Head Pak, bring the shaman here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.75,0:44:25.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Come in
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.55,0:45:16.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi, show your face
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.62,0:45:45.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.75,0:45:51.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Even in my dreams I never imagined that I would see your face again
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.67,0:45:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.51,0:45:58.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I am your wife, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.97,0:46:02.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I, So Ha Sun, Queen Daeho
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.14,0:46:04.14,italics,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.22,0:46:07.35,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you say my name with your dirty mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.02,0:46:09.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the queen of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.85,0:46:11.44,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.19,0:46:13.78,general text,,0,0,0,,You did this to me
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.36,0:46:17.70,general text,,0,0,0,,You, pathetic shaman, used soul alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.78,0:46:20.32,general text,,0,0,0,,to transfer your dirty soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.57,0:46:25.91,general text,,0,0,0,,into my sacred body, the body of the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.00,0:46:27.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your lies
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.50,0:46:30.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy Gwangju, don’t stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.21,0:46:32.29,italics,,0,0,0,,Shut up that crazy woman right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.34,0:46:38.47,italics,,0,0,0,,First, we need to check
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.55,0:46:40.84,general text,,0,0,0,,is she lying or not
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.35,0:46:43.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.47,0:46:46.27,general text,,0,0,0,,She says her soul was transferred
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.35,0:46:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's check if the Queen has a blue mark on her body
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.23,0:46:58.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be happy to show it to you to help get rid of suspicions
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.58,0:47:12.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Should I expose my shoulder here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.29,0:47:16.50,general text,,0,0,0,,The blue mark can be easily removed
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.59,0:47:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise nothing can be proven
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.80,0:47:23.30,general text,,0,0,0,,We have Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.35,0:47:33.69,italics,,0,0,0,,I have ashes
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.77,0:47:38.90,general text,,0,0,0,,cremated dog in which the soul of Gwigu lived
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.61,0:47:43.03,general text,,0,0,0,,What is left of Gwigu's forces will help us...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.54,0:47:49.41,general text,,0,0,0,,reveal the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.21,0:47:56.00,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.84,0:48:02.26,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.27,0:48:10.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.48,0:48:12.60,general text,,0,0,0,,it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.90,0:48:15.61,general text,,0,0,0,,just collected ashes
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:18.07,general text,,0,0,0,,from the brazier
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.00,0:48:33.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You just proved it yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.42,0:48:37.92,general text,,0,0,0,,that you are a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.35,0:48:49.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Grab shaman Choi,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.22,0:48:53.43,general text,,0,0,0,,who used soul alchemy to seize power
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.52,0:48:54.81,general text,,0,0,0,,in the body of the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.89,0:48:55.98,italics,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.60,0:48:57.73,general text,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.27,0:49:04.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Do not harm her. This is my body
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.78,0:49:08.03,general text,,0,0,0,,My soul must return to this body. Don't harm him
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.12,0:49:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t come closer
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.20,0:49:16.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will tear this body into pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.96,0:49:18.83,general text,,0,0,0,,She is a descendant of the magician Choi,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.92,0:49:22.17,general text,,0,0,0,,which caused the Great Chaos 200 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.59,0:49:26.80,general text,,0,0,0,,And the reflectors are probably her work
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.72,0:49:30.22,general text,,0,0,0,,This explains the recent appearances of soul swallowers
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.26,0:49:33.22,italics,,0,0,0,,This is an evil witch
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.31,0:49:35.89,italics,,0,0,0,,showed an ice stone in front of the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.48,0:49:38.44,general text,,0,0,0,,and made everyone look like complete fools
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.61,0:49:41.44,general text,,0,0,0,,All magicians in Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.57,0:49:45.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Royal family, Jeonbugwan and Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.45,0:49:48.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Everyone was fooled
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.57,0:49:53.62,general text,,0,0,0,,brother and sister of the Choi family
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.04,0:49:56.21,general text,,0,0,0,,"Brother and sister"?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.30,0:50:04.67,general text,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.80,0:50:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,are you and this shaman brother and sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.76,0:50:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you a member of the Choi family?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.52,0:50:24.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.36,0:50:30.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.04,0:50:36.41,italics,,0,0,0,,The daughter you recently found, Jin Bu Young,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.50,0:50:38.12,general text,,0,0,0,,also fake,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.33,0:50:40.46,general text,,0,0,0,,which they picked up
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.83,0:50:45.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Her next plan was to move into the body
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.05,0:50:48.38,general text,,0,0,0,,heirs of Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.52,0:51:01.73,italics,,0,0,0,,Shaman Choi,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.81,0:51:03.40,general text,,0,0,0,,put down the dagger
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.48,0:51:06.44,general text,,0,0,0,,and return this body to Her Royal Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.53,0:51:07.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Do as I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.65,0:51:13.49,general text,,0,0,0,,and I will spare your brother's life
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.80,0:51:27.51,general text,,0,0,0,,You say I'm evil
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.17,0:51:31.80,general text,,0,0,0,,But no one is here
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.84,0:51:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,has no right to call me that
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.39,0:51:38.85,italics,,0,0,0,,Want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.93,0:51:42.73,general text,,0,0,0,,how did I manage to take possession of the queen’s sacred body?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.61,0:51:49.07,general text,,0,0,0,,She happily gave me her body because she wanted to move her soul
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.15,0:51:51.74,general text,,0,0,0,,to a young and beautiful body
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.82,0:51:52.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Ho Kyung!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.07,0:51:56.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you the one who announced the ice stone to the whole world?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.12,0:52:01.37,italics,,0,0,0,,You are the head of Jinyoewon, the protector of his relics
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.46,0:52:02.79,general text,,0,0,0,,And you let the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.87,0:52:06.25,general text,,0,0,0,,leave Jinyeowon to use it for alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.84,0:52:11.76,general text,,0,0,0,,And the one who performed the alchemy of souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.22,0:52:15.01,general text,,0,0,0,,was a magician of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.05,0:52:17.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Park Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.64,0:52:20.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You hid the truth despite the fact that you knew everything
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.06,0:52:25.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Acted as if you couldn’t wait to catch everyone who does witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.35,0:52:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,But you were just trying to hide the sin of that magician
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.95,0:52:41.41,general text,,0,0,0,,As for you, Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.83,0:52:46.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there and doing nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.59,0:52:52.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I am the only evil, judging by your logic and justifications,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.26,0:52:56.09,general text,,0,0,0,,that you came up with
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.35,0:53:09.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Logic is determined by power
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.48,0:53:14.36,general text,,0,0,0,,You have lost your power and that makes you evil
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.20,0:53:20.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu, you will not fail to disappoint
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.20,0:53:25.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Your devotion is as fickle as the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.16,0:53:27.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Pass the rest of the reflectors
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.00,0:53:29.50,general text,,0,0,0,,We will return the queen's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.59,0:53:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,and you will not be petrified
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.88,0:53:37.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I advise you to follow my words if you want your brother to live
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.22,0:53:39.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.80,0:53:42.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Use the remaining reflector to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.60,0:53:47.39,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the only thing I can do for you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.94,0:53:51.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.53,0:53:55.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.95,0:53:57.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.61,0:53:59.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.46,0:54:08.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.84,0:54:22.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.41,0:54:46.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I will do as you want and get rid of the evil ice stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.66,0:54:47.87,general text,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.58,0:54:50.54,general text,,0,0,0,,once the ice stone disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.38,0:54:56.34,general text,,0,0,0,,you will all die too
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.39,0:56:32.89,italics,,0,0,0,,- Look\N- What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.83,0:57:32.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.33,0:57:34.29,italics,,0,0,0,,Is this Chang Gan?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.00,0:57:37.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Jang Gang, Jeongbugwan's gwangju?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.38,0:57:41.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Gang, is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.63,0:57:43.46,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.86,0:58:09.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Soul reflector...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.46,0:58:21.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Reflector energy has disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.46,0:58:25.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone stopped it
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.05,0:58:30.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Chang Gang here
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.32,0:58:48.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.95,0:58:52.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You have absorbed the energy of the reflector...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.16,0:58:55.70,general text,,0,0,0,,into your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.54,0:59:05.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t go near him
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.80,0:59:08.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan is a nomad and he has gone wild
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.80,0:59:10.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.13,0:59:13.01,italics,,0,0,0,,His whole body turns to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.64,0:59:16.52,general text,,0,0,0,,He's right
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.85,0:59:20.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I performed the forbidden alchemy of souls and became a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.69,0:59:22.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Now I'm running wild
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.40,0:59:26.11,general text,,0,0,0,,You are Jeonbugwan's gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.19,0:59:28.15,general text,,0,0,0,,And you used witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.24,0:59:31.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Lee Chul, disciple of Master So Kyung,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.36,0:59:35.99,general text,,0,0,0,,ordered me to confess my sins to the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.24,0:59:38.91,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.67,0:59:46.21,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If you still have the strength to read this letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.30,0:59:49.26,memories italics,,0,0,0,,use your remaining strength to help those who suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.34,0:59:51.01,memories italics,,0,0,0,,the mess you made
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.47,0:59:55.26,memories italics,,0,0,0,,This is a chance for you to finish what you started
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.10,0:59:58.93,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Then a star will rise,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.02,1:00:01.06,memories italics,,0,0,0,,and the stone will sink
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.52,1:00:07.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I am responsible
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.40,1:00:11.49,general text,,0,0,0,,for all the mistakes of Sosnovy Bor, Jinyeowon and Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.99,1:00:15.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I took the ice stone from Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.12,1:00:18.12,italics,,0,0,0,,and he committed witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.54,1:00:22.25,italics,,0,0,0,,I tried to keep it a secret
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.75,1:00:26.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I will be petrified here to atone for all my sins
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.17,1:00:32.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Chang Gang was the one who started it all,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.13,1:00:34.68,general text,,0,0,0,,so I'll let him put an end to this
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.76,1:00:37.05,general text,,0,0,0,,death
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.94,1:00:47.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Witness the tragic fall of man,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.69,1:00:50.11,general text,,0,0,0,,who performed witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.19,1:00:52.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe he’s a nomad,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.28,1:00:53.99,general text,,0,0,0,,but you can’t leave him to die like that
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.07,1:00:56.57,general text,,0,0,0,,His son, Chan Wook, inside Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.66,1:00:59.74,italics,,0,0,0,,Wait until Chang Wook gets out of there
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.83,1:01:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,He deserves to say goodbye to his father
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.29,1:01:05.00,general text,,0,0,0,,He is not my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.62,1:01:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You all know that I sealed his energy gate,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.75,1:01:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,to prevent him from following in my footsteps
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.84,1:01:15.55,general text,,0,0,0,,His childhood was already sad
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.80,1:01:19.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t let him be known as the son of a sinner
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.87,1:02:28.33,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.09,1:02:36.80,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.52,1:02:50.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, it happened
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.77,1:02:53.52,general text,,0,0,0,,My energy has disappeared
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.29,1:03:15.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this an ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.80,1:03:20.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Found him when all my strength left me
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.39,1:03:23.68,general text,,0,0,0,,For me now
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.89,1:03:26.64,general text,,0,0,0,,this is nothing more than just a stone
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.21,1:03:53.00,italics,,0,0,0,,This is the King’s star!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.08,1:03:55.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The Star of the King lit up in the sky
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.12,1:04:35.00,general text,,0,0,0,,The King’s star shone in the sky, and the barrier slept
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.81,1:04:51.56,italics,,0,0,0,,The ice stone has disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.52,1:04:54.69,italics,,0,0,0,,and the King’s star appeared
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.90,1:04:58.23,general text,,0,0,0,,When Master So Kyung stopped the Great Chaos
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.32,1:05:00.69,general text,,0,0,0,,the King’s star also appeared
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.53,1:05:04.70,italics,,0,0,0,,So someone is inside Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.78,1:05:07.82,italics,,0,0,0,,was born with the same fate as Master Seo Kyung?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.93,1:05:29.76,general text,,0,0,0,,The Star of the King above him
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.85,1:05:31.77,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s him!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.70,1:05:48.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.12,1:05:52.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The Star of the King has shone for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.29,1:05:54.50,general text,,0,0,0,,- Your Highness!\N- Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.09,1:06:12.01,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook was born under the sign of the King's star
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.31,1:06:16.10,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Did he get rid of the ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.30,1:06:46.38,voiceover,,0,0,0,,My student, you have lost all your energy
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.22,1:06:52.22,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Teacher, you too have become just Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.85,1:06:56.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t mind
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.39,1:06:58.98,general text,,0,0,0,,while we are together
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.51,1:07:38.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard that the wedding will take place in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.18,1:07:40.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course. Groom - magician of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.44,1:07:43.23,general text,,0,0,0,,I do not approve of their wedding
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.31,1:07:45.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe they’re getting married
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.82,1:07:47.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I've seen them together a couple of times
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.86,1:07:49.53,general text,,0,0,0,,They look good together
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.61,1:07:52.41,general text,,0,0,0,,What? They could have chosen a better groom
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.49,1:07:53.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.95,1:07:55.87,italics,,0,0,0,,The same can be said about the bride
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.95,1:07:57.66,general text,,0,0,0,,People were just talking
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.74,1:08:00.08,general text,,0,0,0,,about the United Council and the King’s star
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.16,1:08:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,And now they are discussing the upcoming wedding
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.63,1:08:07.88,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s why the head insisted on the wedding
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.96,1:08:11.34,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, I still can’t believe that these two are getting married
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.01,1:08:17.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul, I heard that you haven’t eaten anything
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.06,1:08:19.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll eat when I’m hungry
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.06,1:08:21.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Let me prepare some kuksa for you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.39,1:08:24.02,general text,,0,0,0,,And you need to take medicine
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.11,1:08:29.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need medicine anymore. Stop bothering me with them
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.73,1:08:31.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You are returning to Soho Fortress soon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.70,1:08:33.66,general text,,0,0,0,,You need to eat well while you are here...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.04,1:08:41.54,general text,,0,0,0,,My wound has healed
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.54,1:08:43.92,general text,,0,0,0,,The energy has returned too
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.46,1:08:47.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you moaning in pain in your sleep
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.59,1:08:50.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you're lying
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.59,1:08:54.09,general text,,0,0,0,,The wound hardly hurts
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.06,1:09:03.39,general text,,0,0,0,,You are such a bad liar
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.19,1:09:08.23,general text,,0,0,0,,You have a pure heart, so every time you lie,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.82,1:09:10.82,general text,,0,0,0,,this is obvious
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.78,1:09:14.53,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s written right on your face
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.70,1:09:19.62,general text,,0,0,0,,It must have been difficult for you to hide it for so long
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.25,1:09:28.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.55,1:09:32.01,general text,,0,0,0,,And thank you,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.88,1:09:35.09,general text,,0,0,0,,what they defended
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.68,1:09:45.14,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Yul protected you all this time
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.77,1:09:50.82,memories,,0,0,0,,He knows who you are
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.19,1:09:53.69,memories,,0,0,0,,Knows that you are a nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.78,1:09:55.65,memories,,0,0,0,,Knows that you are Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.53,1:09:58.32,memories,,0,0,0,,He tried so hard not to show it
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.70,1:10:07.46,memories,,0,0,0,,He really wanted to protect the girl he met in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.92,1:10:17.38,general text,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.47,1:10:20.60,general text,,0,0,0,,belongs to your friend from Danhyangk
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.10,1:10:23.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.31,1:10:27.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take her with me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.69,1:10:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,to the Soho fortress
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.53,1:10:39.07,general text,,0,0,0,,She had a secret that she hid from everyone
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.16,1:10:43.45,general text,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to take her there and hide her
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.25,1:10:49.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I promised you that I would help
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.75,1:10:53.67,general text,,0,0,0,,take her with you
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.71,1:10:59.59,general text,,0,0,0,,But this person now exists only in your memories
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.55,1:11:02.43,general text,,0,0,0,,She is no longer in this world
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.65,1:11:13.15,general text,,0,0,0,,At first I thought,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.23,1:11:16.48,general text,,0,0,0,,cremation will erase her from your memory
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.94,1:11:20.57,general text,,0,0,0,,But you said that you cherish the memories from Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.33,1:11:27.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Take him with you
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.05,1:11:43.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I want to make sure that you are on the mend
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.14,1:11:46.39,general text,,0,0,0,,So I want to feel your three breaths
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.20,1:12:09.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's say goodbye to each other
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.00,1:12:14.79,general text,,0,0,0,,while these three breaths last
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.31,1:12:29.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Memories were dear to me too
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.73,1:12:33.60,general text,,0,0,0,,from Danhyanggok
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.74,1:12:42.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.94,1:13:25.53,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems your wound is healing well
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.91,1:13:31.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I know the medicine is bitter, but take it regularly
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.38,1:13:39.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.17,1:13:43.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I will drink, no matter how bitter it is
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.18,1:13:49.89,general text,,0,0,0,,This time the whole wound will heal
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.26,1:14:32.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Sacrificing my life,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.68,1:14:38.02,general text,,0,0,0,,your father took responsibility for what happened
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.90,1:14:42.07,italics,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his sacrifice, Sosnovy Bor and Jinyeowon were not punished
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.95,1:14:52.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he denied that you are his son,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.20,1:14:57.62,general text,,0,0,0,,because he didn’t want you to be blamed for his sins
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.29,1:15:02.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.13,1:15:07.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I no longer care about the fact that he may not be my father
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.43,1:15:14.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.77,1:15:17.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You haven’t met before
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.52,1:15:21.90,general text,,0,0,0,,We met once
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.31,1:15:24.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Perhaps then
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.03,1:15:27.49,general text,,0,0,0,,he recognized me
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.57,1:15:29.86,memories italics,,0,0,0,,It seems you
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.57,1:15:32.24,memories,,0,0,0,,you know who I am
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.91,1:15:35.24,memories,,0,0,0,,You have the sword of Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.33,1:15:36.83,memories,,0,0,0,,You must be his son
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.73,1:16:12.11,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the sword and robe that the royal family gave to Chang Gan,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.20,1:16:15.49,general text,,0,0,0,,former gwangju of Jeonbugwan, who died due to witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.58,1:16:20.29,general text,,0,0,0,,We would like you to decide what we should do with his things
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.87,1:16:22.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Leave in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.75,1:16:25.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you found Deputy Jin Mu?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.59,1:16:27.71,general text,,0,0,0,,We are still looking for him
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.71,1:16:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,We are sure he has not left the capital yet
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.59,1:16:33.30,general text,,0,0,0,,He could take possession of another body
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.55,1:16:36.97,general text,,0,0,0,,If he does to himself the same thing as to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.05,1:16:38.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Does Sosnovy Bor recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.77,1:16:41.98,general text,,0,0,0,,You have been fooled all these years
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:47.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.32,1:16:51.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Kang from Degangtongun went mad and petrified,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.11,1:16:53.20,general text,,0,0,0,,but Saejukwon managed to save him
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.82,1:16:57.37,general text,,0,0,0,,If you ever go wild and start to turn to stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.45,1:16:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,we know a way to save you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.54,1:17:01.83,general text,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.37,1:17:07.04,general text,,0,0,0,,I will have to live in this terrible body for the rest of my days
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.17,1:17:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,You allowed Chan Wook to live, although his father is guilty of
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.01,1:17:14.13,general text,,0,0,0,,what happened to me
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.22,1:17:15.51,italics,,0,0,0,,Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.09,1:17:18.60,general text,,0,0,0,,took full responsibility, sacrificing himself
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.51,1:17:21.47,general text,,0,0,0,,We also deprived Chan Wook of his rights
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.35,1:17:25.94,general text,,0,0,0,,become Jeonbugwan's next gwangju
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.15,1:17:28.94,general text,,0,0,0,,He washed away his sins,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.82,1:17:32.19,general text,,0,0,0,,losing everything I had
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.03,1:17:37.57,general text,,0,0,0,,When Chang Gang died, he admitted that Wook was not his son
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.66,1:17:39.70,general text,,0,0,0,,We cannot shift responsibility to him
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:43.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Gang died without revealing the name of Wook's real father
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.63,1:17:53.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Master Chang Gan wanted,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.22,1:17:56.51,memories,,0,0,0,,so that I give this to you
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.35,1:18:03.93,memories,,0,0,0,,He said it would reveal the truth
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.93,1:18:07.14,memories,,0,0,0,,about Mr. Chan Wook's real father
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.42,1:18:31.59,memories,,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.84,1:18:35.88,memories,,0,0,0,,now you, maid Kim, know the truth
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.51,1:18:38.97,memories,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.01,1:18:43.81,memories,,0,0,0,,Lady Do Hwa gave birth to the son of the late king?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.47,1:18:47.64,memories,,0,0,0,,Uka was conceived when the late king moved his soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.77,1:18:51.48,memories,,0,0,0,,and lay down with Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.19,1:18:56.53,memories,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan performed alchemy and exchanged souls...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.57,1:19:00.20,memories,,0,0,0,,with the late king
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.28,1:19:07.12,memories,,0,0,0,,Master Chang Gan ruined the life of his son
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.96,1:19:10.58,general text,,0,0,0,,If the gentleman finds out about this...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.08,1:19:13.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t reveal this
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.17,1:19:18.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Not only Uku,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.97,1:19:21.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I will keep this a secret from everyone
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.93,1:19:29.27,general text,,0,0,0,,The star that appeared in the sky when you destroyed the ice stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.35,1:19:31.73,general text,,0,0,0,,was engraved on the constellation tablet
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.81,1:19:35.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone is happy to welcome the king, born under the law of the star of the King
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.57,1:19:37.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Would you like to look at the sign?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.15,1:19:40.32,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.71,1:19:54.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.13,1:19:57.51,general text,,0,0,0,,relocated the soul and disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.29,1:20:30.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Hidden in Jeonbugwan all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.00,1:20:34.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I have been waiting for the opportunity to meet you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.75,1:20:39.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to save your life?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.26,1:20:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Only you can save me,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.97,1:20:45.64,general text,,0,0,0,,and only I can protect you
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.39,1:20:49.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Protect me? From what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.22,1:20:52.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I will protect you from the true heir to the King's star
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.19,1:20:56.44,general text,,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about?\N{\i1}- You already know,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.52,1:20:58.94,general text,,0,0,0,,you are not the true heir
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.82,1:21:08.74,general text,,0,0,0,,The man who will outshine you... The man who will be worshiped
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.83,1:21:12.66,general text,,0,0,0,,The man who will defeat you
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.25,1:21:14.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You are only second in line to the throne
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.75,1:21:17.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, the heir of the star, should not be allowed,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.50,1:21:19.75,general text,,0,0,0,,rise above you
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.92,1:21:26.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I promise to save you from this ominous light
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.39,1:21:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,The only thing I was desperately striving for...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.35,1:21:39.11,general text,,0,0,0,,actually belongs to Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.01,1:22:10.18,general text,,0,0,0,,How cute. You are beautiful
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.76,1:22:14.48,general text,,0,0,0,,You look great
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.64,1:22:18.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Wipe up your drool
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.69,1:22:20.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- You can take it off now\N- Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.90,1:22:23.65,general text,,0,0,0,,actually asked me to wear this? Why not the bride?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.73,1:22:27.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Her father is in very bad condition, so she could not come
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.15,1:22:29.53,general text,,0,0,0,,You and she have a similar physique, so
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.12,1:22:31.33,general text,,0,0,0,,You can change your clothes
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.87,1:22:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go so she can change clothes
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.87,1:22:38.79,italics,,0,0,0,,- Stop staring. Let's go\N- She's the most beautiful girl I've ever seen
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.87,1:22:40.21,general text,,0,0,0,,It's true
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.00,1:22:45.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.09,1:22:47.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I look cute
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.55,1:22:50.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.72,1:22:52.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Mu Dok here? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.56,1:22:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok now...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.64,1:22:58.44,general text,,0,0,0,,She is in that room
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.52,1:22:59.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- Come in\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.70,1:23:11.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.74,1:23:15.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard someone is getting married soon
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.87,1:23:16.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.71,1:23:18.71,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.84,1:23:25.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Look, this is my teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.46,1:23:28.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait for me in Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.67,1:23:31.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- Why are you here?\N- Ho Yeom sent me for wine
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.59,1:23:33.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah Joo Wol asked to wear this
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.35,1:23:36.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to change clothes. Wait outside
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.27,1:23:37.56,general text,,0,0,0,,No, wait
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.64,1:23:40.77,general text,,0,0,0,,This place is suitable. This is where we first met
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.31,1:23:43.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Suitable for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.82,1:23:48.19,general text,,0,0,0,,For the ritual that we must perform
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.15,1:23:50.82,italics,,0,0,0,,First, sit here
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.71,1:24:03.17,general text,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.00,1:24:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,This is optional
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.84,1:24:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop. You're embarrassing me. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.43,1:24:19.31,general text,,0,0,0,,This is only confusing at first
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.39,1:24:21.19,general text,,0,0,0,,But after the 13th time you get used to it
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.48,1:24:23.56,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.19,1:24:26.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you proposed 13 times?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.78,1:24:29.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.61,1:24:34.16,general text,,0,0,0,,today I want to finish my training with you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.24,1:24:40.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for making me train hard
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.83,1:24:43.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Even though I was a complete idiot
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.25,1:24:46.42,italics,,0,0,0,,I know,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.50,1:24:48.88,general text,,0,0,0,,you left the opportunity to regain your power
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.67,1:24:52.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Just as I gave up the energy that I so wanted to own
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.72,1:24:57.76,general text,,0,0,0,,But I have something that I want to keep next to me all my life
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.56,1:25:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to be used and thrown away. I want to protect and take care
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.65,1:25:09.61,general text,,0,0,0,,So... let me go
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.99,1:25:16.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Your teacher, Moo Deok,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.57,1:25:19.70,general text,,0,0,0,,allows his student Chan Wook to leave
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.46,1:25:25.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.71,1:25:29.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Marry me, Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.83,1:26:04.58,preview,,0,0,0,,I decided to marry the owner
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.66,1:26:05.87,preview,,0,0,0,,You didn’t even have a girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.96,1:26:07.67,preview,,0,0,0,,That's all for Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.75,1:26:08.67,preview,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.75,1:26:12.55,preview,,0,0,0,,I will find a sword that will allow you to hit Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.63,1:26:14.97,preview,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu must die
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.05,1:26:18.59,preview,,0,0,0,,Are you saying they all deceived me and mocked me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.68,1:26:20.97,preview,,0,0,0,,They are trying to protect Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.05,1:26:23.10,preview,,0,0,0,,A killer has appeared in Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.18,1:26:25.10,preview,,0,0,0,,I think Moo Deok's body originally belonged to...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.18,1:26:27.10,preview,,0,0,0,,to someone with great divine power
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.27,1:26:31.98,preview,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo, you gave me hope
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:57.24,nicks,,0,0,0,,

